    <title>Linux应用开发学习：线程 其二</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/22/Linux-sys-learn/11-thread-2/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/22/Linux-sys-learn/11-thread-2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="Linux应用开发学习：线程-其二"><a href="#Linux应用开发学习：线程-其二" class="headerlink" title="Linux应用开发学习：线程 其二"></a>Linux应用开发学习：线程 其二</h1><h2 id="线程取消-pthread-cancel"><a href="#线程取消-pthread-cancel" class="headerlink" title="线程取消 pthread_cancel"></a>线程取消 pthread_cancel</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pthread_cancel</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">pthread_t</span> thread)</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>该库函数可以对进程内一个指定的线程进行取消</p><ul><li>pthread_t thread: 要取消的线程号</li><li>返回值: 取消请求成功返回0, 取消请求失败返回错误号(不会设置errno)<br>该库函数仅仅是向指定的线程提出取消，所以通过这个可知，发送取消请求后，该函数会立即返回<br>而被控制的线程一般是可以被取消的，但是线程本身可以设定自己不被取消&#x2F;以何种方式取消，这一点会在后面提及</li></ul><h3 id="取消状态-类型"><a href="#取消状态-类型" class="headerlink" title="取消状态&#x2F;类型"></a>取消状态&#x2F;类型</h3><ol><li>设置取消状态</li></ol><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pthread_setcancelstate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> state, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> *oldstate)</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>state: 要给线程设置的新的取消状态，有PTHREAD_CANCEL_ENABLE(可取消，默认值)， PTHREAD_CANCEL_DISABLE(不可取消)</li><li>oldstate: 线程的旧取消状态，用来保存旧值，若你不关心旧状态，填入NULL</li></ul><ol><li>设置取消类型</li></ol><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pthread_setcanceltype</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> type, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> *oldtype)</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>type: 要给线程设置的新的取消类型，有PTHREAD_CANCEL_DEFERRED(到达取消点，默认值)， PTHREAD_CANCEL_ASYNCHRONOUS(可能在任意时刻响应取消请求，它可能打断持锁、内存分配等操作，导致资源或内部状态出问题。)</li><li>oldtype: 线程的旧取消类型，用来保存旧值，若你不关心旧类型，填入NULL<br>相关的设置取消状态的子线程函数如下</li></ul><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span>* <span class="hljs-title function_">hand_thread</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>* arg)</span> &#123;<br>  pthread_setcancelstate(PTHREAD_CANCEL_DISABLE, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(;;) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;子线程运行中...&quot;</span>);<br>    sleep(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>);<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (<span class="hljs-type">void</span> *)<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可以看到，在存在取消点sleep(2)的时候，该线程并没有停止，这就是线程可以自己决定自己的死活喵喵喵</p><h3 id="取消点"><a href="#取消点" class="headerlink" title="取消点"></a>取消点</h3><p>在之前，我们提及了取消点sleep()，但是除了这个取消点之外，还有其他取消点，有以下的取消点<br><img src="/2026/10/22/Linux-sys-learn/11-thread-2/cancel_point.png" alt="取消点列表"><br>除了这些取消点之外，我们还可以通过<code>man 7 pthreads</code>进行查询（哼哼，一般我都不看上面的表，我直接查了）<br><img src="/2026/10/22/Linux-sys-learn/11-thread-2/cancel_point_search.png" alt="Man查询取消点列表"></p><div class="note note-info">            <p>平时我们学习的时候也需要学会经常利用man或者文档去查询东西喵🐱</p>           </div><p>但如果我们线程内是一个没有取消点的循环，例如for, while, 在默认的延迟取消类型下，这时候线程永远不会响应取消, 例如</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span>* <span class="hljs-title function_">hand_thread</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>* arg)</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(;;) &#123;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (<span class="hljs-type">void</span> *)<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>调用这个函数后发现，这个线程不响应取消请求，所以整个线程进入死循环<br>那如果我们在线程内设置一个pthread_testcancel()，去主动检查取消请求</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span>* <span class="hljs-title function_">hand_thread</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>* arg)</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(;;) &#123;<br>    pthread_testcancel();<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (<span class="hljs-type">void</span> *)<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> argc, <span class="hljs-type">char</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span>* argv[])</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">pthread_t</span> tid;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">void</span>* vret;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br>  ret = pthread_create(&amp;tid, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>, hand_thread, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pthread create error:%s\n&quot;</span>, strerror(ret));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>);<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-built_in">puts</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;线程创建成功！&quot;</span>);<br>  sleep(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>  ret = pthread_cancel(tid);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pthread_cancel error: %s\n&quot;</span>, strerror(ret));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>);<br>  &#125;<br>  ret = pthread_join(tid, &amp;vret);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pthread_join error: %s\n&quot;</span>, strerror(ret));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>);<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (vret != PTHREAD_CANCELED) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;子线程未按预期被取消\n&quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-built_in">puts</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;子线程已被取消&quot;</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行后发现，我们这个线程可以退出了！那我们<code>pthread_testcancel()</code>本身就是一个取消点<br>更准确的是，这个库函数会检测当前是否有取消请求，若有，则响应取消并退出线程</p><h3 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h3><p>线程取消实际上并不是强制取消的，实际上是看被取消线程的意愿的<br>哼哼，一个愿打，一个不愿意挨🐱</p><h2 id="线程分离-detach-pthread-attr-setdetachstate"><a href="#线程分离-detach-pthread-attr-setdetachstate" class="headerlink" title="线程分离 detach&#x2F;pthread_attr_setdetachstate"></a>线程分离 detach&#x2F;pthread_attr_setdetachstate</h2><p>当某个线程的处理结果，其他的线程不关心的时候，就可以将这个线程分离开来，直接由系统&#x2F;进程去回收该线程相关的资源，而不是需要某个线程去回收资源</p><h3 id="线程内分离-detach"><a href="#线程内分离-detach" class="headerlink" title="线程内分离 detach"></a>线程内分离 detach</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;pthread.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pthread_detach</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">pthread_t</span> thread)</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>pthread_t thread: 要分离的线程 ID</li><li>返回值: 分离成功返回0, 分离失败返回错误号(不会设置errno)<br>分离后的线程不能再用 pthread_join() 等待和回收</li></ul><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span>* <span class="hljs-title function_">hand_thread</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>* arg)</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br>  ret = pthread_detach(pthread_self());<br>  sleep(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;子线程运行中&quot;</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (<span class="hljs-type">void</span> *)<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>)</span> &#123;<br>  ···<br>  ret = pthread_join(tid, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret)<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pthread_join error: %s\n&quot;</span>, strerror(ret));<br>  ···<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果如下<br><img src="/2026/10/22/Linux-sys-learn/11-thread-2/detach_error.png" alt="回收线程失败"><br>可以看到我们join成功出错了，报错pthread join error:Invalid argument，这说明我们不能将其回收</p><div class="note note-info">            <p>以上是本次运行结果。子线程自行分离与主线程调用 pthread_join() 存在执行顺序竞争，因此不能保证每次都得到相同结果。</p>           </div><h3 id="创建时分离"><a href="#创建时分离" class="headerlink" title="创建时分离"></a>创建时分离</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;pthread.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pthread_attr_setdetachstate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">pthread_attr_t</span> *attr, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> detachstate)</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pthread_attr_getdetachstate</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">pthread_attr_t</span> *attr, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> *detachstate)</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>*attr: 创建线程的时候所需的参数指针</li><li>detachstate: 需要设置的线程分离状态，有PTHREAD_CREATE_DETACHED(分离), PTHREAD_CREATE_JOINABLE(不分离, 默认)</li><li>*detachstate: 获取线程分离状态的时候，获取到的状态需要存放的地址</li><li>返回值: 分离成功返回0, 分离失败返回错误号(不会设置errno)<br>这个分离方式，是在创建线程之前，通过参数去设置创建时候确定是否分离线程喵</li></ul><div class="note note-info">            <p>我更加的推荐这样的设置方式喵🐱，因为这样的设置方式在线程创建之前就明确了，该线程我们不关心返回结果，只是派出去处理数据而已，更符合线程分离的定义</p>           </div><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">void</span>* <span class="hljs-title function_">thread_hand</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span>* arg)</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-built_in">puts</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello World!&quot;</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (<span class="hljs-type">void</span>*)<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> argc, <span class="hljs-type">char</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span>* argv[])</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">pthread_attr_t</span> attr;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">pthread_t</span> tid;<br>  <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br>  <span class="hljs-comment">/* init attr */</span><br>  pthread_attr_init(&amp;attr);<br>  <span class="hljs-comment">/* init detachstate */</span><br>  pthread_attr_setdetachstate(&amp;attr, PTHREAD_CREATE_DETACHED);<br>  <span class="hljs-comment">/* create thread */</span><br>  ret = pthread_create(&amp;tid, &amp;attr, thread_hand, <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pthread create error:%s\n&quot;</span>, strerror(ret));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">exit</span>(<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>);<br>  &#125;<br><br>  sleep(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-comment">/* destroy attr */</span><br>  pthread_attr_destroy(&amp;attr);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2026/10/22/Linux-sys-learn/11-thread-2/attr_setdetach.png" alt="程序运行结果"></p><div class="note note-info">            <p>以上所有代码的sleep()只是给子线程留出演示时间，不能保证它执行完成。</p>           </div><h3 id="总结-1"><a href="#总结-1" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h3><p>一句话总结: 总之就是，em…你分离之后就，你这个小线程没人管你了啊哈哈，自生自灭去吧<br>当然当前进程还是管你的，当main主线程结束后会终止所有正在运行的线程喵</p>]]></content>
    
    
